OL,3,GNEWSABlack Eyed Peas among Victorious  
OL,4,Aheadliners                             
OL,6,FThe Prodigy, Black Eyed Peas and Pet   
OL,7,FShop Boys have been revealed as the    
OL,8,Fheadliners for next year's Victorious  
OL,9,FFestival in Portsmouth.                
OL,11,FThe Human League will also make an     
OL,12,Fappearance, along with Cruz Beckham and
OL,13,Findie bands The Fratellis, The Kooks   
OL,14,Fand Ocean Colour Scene.                
OL,16,FThe three-day bank holiday weekend     
OL,17,Ffestival will take place on Southsea   
OL,18,FCommon between 27-29 August.           
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
