OL,3,GNEWSABlack Eyed Peas among Victorious  
OL,4,Aheadliners                             
OL,6,FOrganisers said: "We're proud to be    
OL,7,Fbringing some of the most iconic names 
OL,8,Fin music to Southsea seafront, with a  
OL,9,Fbrilliant mix of artists spanning      
OL,10,Fgenres and generations."               
